## 6. INTERACTIVE FEATURES

1. Interactive Comic Reading: as specified in Section 5B.

2. Story-to-Science Connection: page-level science links (markers, chip, side panel/bottom sheet), "Return to the story" links from every Science entry, and chapter-end science summaries.

3. Knowledge Quizzes: a short quiz (3-5 multiple-choice questions) for each chapter, reached from the chapter-end screen and the library. One question at a time, instant feedback after answering, a short explanation with a link to the related Science entry, a final score, "Retry" and "Back to the story" actions. Quiz questions must rely only on approved, sourced facts (Section 8). Seed each chapter's quiz with questions based on the approved seed definitions.

4. Achievement Badges: restrained, elegant badge emblems (minimal SVG in blue/cyan). Locked state is dimmed. Unlock moment is a short, tasteful animation and a small toast. Badges:
