5. Space Discovery Cards: as specified in Section 5D.

6. Smooth Animations: as specified in Section 3.5, with excellent performance.

Persistence: store progress, quiz scores, badges and discovered topics in localStorage with a versioned key. Wrap all reads and writes in try/catch, and the site must work correctly when storage is unavailable or empty. No accounts, no server.

Do not add any feature that does not provide real value to the visitor.

