## 10. UI/UX QUALITY STANDARDS (STRICT)

The final result must satisfy all of the following:
- A complete, cohesive platform, not just a landing page.
- A consistent visual identity across every page, using the same tokens, spacing, components and motion rules.
- A clear visual hierarchy on every screen, with one focal point.
- Professional spacing and alignment, with a consistent grid.
- Clear, readable typography with a defined scale.
- Cinematic use of imagery with proper overlays and credits.
- Restrained visual effects. Nothing flashy, nothing that harms performance or readability.
- Easy navigation between sections, with the current location always clear.
- An excellent comic reading experience: original proportions, fast page turns, no distractions.
- No dead buttons, no fake links, no empty states without a message, no broken images.
- No undocumented scientific claims or numbers.
- No purple anywhere in the interface.
- Attention to small details: hover, focus and active states, loading skeletons, empty states, toasts, consistent border radius, smooth scroll offsets under the sticky header, favicon, page titles.

